# Local, untracked notes and captures.
#
# Everything under docs/local/ records the real corp hostnames, resolver
# addresses and network details that the tracked files deliberately refer to only
# as "Work VPN" and "Office-WiFi". It stays out of git; the tracked scripts read
# site-specific values from chezmoi data (`corpHost`) instead.
#
# docs/ is already excluded from the chezmoi target state by .chezmoiignore, so
# nothing here is deployed to $HOME either.
docs/local/
